{"module":"/assets/explain/knowledge/case-merge.js","part":"figure","scope":"case-merge","title":"分情况讨论：每种情况先取交集，最后取并集","note":"例：$x\\in[0,2]$ 时 $x^2-2mx+1>0$ 恒成立，按对称轴 $x=m$ 在区间左侧、区间里、区间右侧分三种情况。点「下一步」逐个看：每种情况解出的范围先和这种情况的前提取交集，三个结果再取并集。","after":"conditions","stylesheet":"/assets/explain/knowledge/case-merge.css","version":"1142cc8043db","html":"<div class=\"cm-explorer\">\n      <p class=\"cm-example\" data-math-text>例：当 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in[0,2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=x^2-2mx+1&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span> 恒成立，求 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span> 的取值范围。</p>\n      <svg class=\"cm-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 450\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"cm-graph-title\">\n    <title id=\"cm-graph-title\">三种情况各自的前提、解出的范围和交集，最后取并集</title>\n    <path d=\"M137.42857142857144 34V442\" class=\"cm-guide\"/><path d=\"M193.14285714285714 34V442\" class=\"cm-guide\"/><path d=\"M248.85714285714286 34V442\" class=\"cm-guide\"/><path d=\"M262.78571428571433 34V442\" class=\"cm-guide\"/><path d=\"M304.57142857142856 34V442\" class=\"cm-guide\"/>\n    <path d=\"M98 30H344\" class=\"cm-scale\"/>\n    <path d=\"M137.42857142857144 26V34\" class=\"cm-scale\"/><text x=\"137.42857142857144\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"cm-tick\">−1</text><path d=\"M193.14285714285714 26V34\" class=\"cm-scale\"/><text x=\"193.14285714285714\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"cm-tick\">0</text><path d=\"M248.85714285714286 26V34\" class=\"cm-scale\"/><text x=\"251.85714285714286\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"cm-tick\">1</text><path d=\"M262.78571428571433 26V34\" class=\"cm-scale\"/><g class=\"cm-tick\"><text x=\"264.3\" y=\"12.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"font-size:10.2px\">5</text><rect x=\"260.8\" y=\"13.6\" width=\"7.1\" height=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"264.3\" y=\"22.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"font-size:10.2px\">4</text></g><path d=\"M304.57142857142856 26V34\" class=\"cm-scale\"/><text x=\"304.57142857142856\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"cm-tick\">2</text>\n    <text x=\"348\" y=\"34\" class=\"cm-tick m\">m</text>\n    <g class=\"cm-step\" data-cm-step=\"1\">\n      <text x=\"8\" y=\"72\" class=\"cm-head\">情况①　对称轴在区间左侧</text>\n      <path d=\"M104 94H338\" class=\"cm-track\"/>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"98\" class=\"cm-label\">前提</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"cm-value premise\">m≤0</text><path d=\"M104 94H193.14285714285714\" class=\"cm-bar premise\"/><path d=\"M104 94L112 89V99Z\" class=\"cm-arrow premise\"/><circle cx=\"193.14285714285714\" cy=\"94\" r=\"4.2\" class=\"cm-dot premise\"/>\n      <path d=\"M104 118H338\" class=\"cm-track\"/>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"122\" class=\"cm-label\">解出</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"cm-value solved\">全部满足</text><path d=\"M104 118H338\" class=\"cm-bar solved\"/><path d=\"M104 118L112 113V123Z\" class=\"cm-arrow solved\"/><path d=\"M338 118L330 113V123Z\" class=\"cm-arrow solved\"/>\n      <path d=\"M104 142H338\" class=\"cm-track\"/>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"146\" class=\"cm-label\">取交集</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"cm-value result\">m≤0</text><path d=\"M104 142H193.14285714285714\" class=\"cm-bar result\"/><path d=\"M104 142L112 137V147Z\" class=\"cm-arrow result\"/><circle cx=\"193.14285714285714\" cy=\"142\" r=\"4.2\" class=\"cm-dot result\"/>\n    </g><g class=\"cm-step\" data-cm-step=\"2\">\n      <text x=\"8\" y=\"184\" class=\"cm-head\">情况②　对称轴在区间里</text>\n      <path d=\"M104 206H338\" class=\"cm-track\"/>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"210\" class=\"cm-label\">前提</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"cm-value premise\">0&lt;m&lt;2</text><path d=\"M193.14285714285714 206H304.57142857142856\" class=\"cm-bar premise\"/><circle cx=\"193.14285714285714\" cy=\"206\" r=\"4.2\" class=\"cm-dot premise open\"/><circle cx=\"304.57142857142856\" cy=\"206\" r=\"4.2\" class=\"cm-dot premise open\"/>\n      <path d=\"M104 230H338\" class=\"cm-track\"/>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"234\" class=\"cm-label\">解出</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"cm-value solved\">−1&lt;m&lt;1</text><path d=\"M137.42857142857144 230H248.85714285714286\" class=\"cm-bar solved\"/><circle cx=\"137.42857142857144\" cy=\"230\" r=\"4.2\" class=\"cm-dot solved open\"/><circle cx=\"248.85714285714286\" cy=\"230\" r=\"4.2\" class=\"cm-dot solved open\"/>\n      <path d=\"M104 254H338\" class=\"cm-track\"/>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"258\" class=\"cm-label\">取交集</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"cm-value result\">0&lt;m&lt;1</text><path d=\"M193.14285714285714 254H248.85714285714286\" class=\"cm-bar result\"/><circle cx=\"193.14285714285714\" cy=\"254\" r=\"4.2\" class=\"cm-dot result open\"/><circle cx=\"248.85714285714286\" cy=\"254\" r=\"4.2\" class=\"cm-dot result open\"/>\n    </g><g class=\"cm-step\" data-cm-step=\"3\">\n      <text x=\"8\" y=\"296\" class=\"cm-head\">情况③　对称轴在区间右侧</text>\n      <path d=\"M104 318H338\" class=\"cm-track\"/>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"322\" class=\"cm-label\">前提</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"322\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"cm-value premise\">m≥2</text><path d=\"M304.57142857142856 318H338\" class=\"cm-bar premise\"/><circle cx=\"304.57142857142856\" cy=\"318\" r=\"4.2\" class=\"cm-dot premise\"/><path d=\"M338 318L330 313V323Z\" class=\"cm-arrow premise\"/>\n      <path d=\"M104 342H338\" class=\"cm-track\"/>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"346\" class=\"cm-label\">解出</text><g class=\"cm-value solved\"><text x=\"61.3\" y=\"346\">m&lt;</text><text x=\"87.4\" y=\"340.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"font-size:10.2px\">5</text><rect x=\"83.9\" y=\"341.6\" width=\"7.1\" height=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"87.4\" y=\"350.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"font-size:10.2px\">4</text></g><path d=\"M104 342H262.78571428571433\" class=\"cm-bar solved\"/><path d=\"M104 342L112 337V347Z\" class=\"cm-arrow solved\"/><circle cx=\"262.78571428571433\" cy=\"342\" r=\"4.2\" class=\"cm-dot solved open\"/>\n      <path d=\"M104 366H338\" class=\"cm-track\"/>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"370\" class=\"cm-label\">取交集</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"cm-value result\">无解</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"cm-empty\">空集：没有公共部分</text>\n    </g>\n    <g class=\"cm-step\" data-cm-step=\"4\">\n      <text x=\"8\" y=\"408\" class=\"cm-head union\">合并：三种情况取并集</text>\n      <path d=\"M104 430H338\" class=\"cm-track\"/>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"434\" class=\"cm-label\">并集</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"434\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"cm-value union\">m&lt;1</text><path d=\"M104 430H248.85714285714286\" class=\"cm-bar union\"/><path d=\"M104 430L112 425V435Z\" class=\"cm-arrow union\"/><circle cx=\"248.85714285714286\" cy=\"430\" r=\"4.2\" class=\"cm-dot union open\"/>\n    </g>\n  </svg>\n      <ol class=\"cm-steps\" aria-live=\"polite\"><li data-cm-text=\"0\" data-math-text>对称轴 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span> 在区间左侧、区间里、区间右侧时，最小值在不同的地方取到，所以分三种情况。</li><li data-cm-text=\"1\" data-math-text>情况① <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\le0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span> 上递增，最小值 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0)=1&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>。这种情况下的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span> 全部满足，结果就是整个前提 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\le0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><spa